1     0.73     0.94  1924    1\r\nsigma[4]        0.54    0.00 0.09     0.38     0.47     0.53     0.59     0.74  2498    1</span></pre><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:楷体,monospace;font-size:18.6667px;outline:currentcolor;border:medium;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><span role=\"document\" style=\"outline:none\"><br></span></pre><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:楷体,monospace;font-size:18.6667px;outline:currentcolor;border:medium;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">......</pre><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:楷体,monospace;font-size:18.6667px;outline:currentcolor;border:medium;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;white-space:pre-wrap!important\"><br></pre><pre aria-label=\"Console Output\" role=\"document\" style=\"font-family:楷体,monospace;font-size:18.6667px;outline:currentcolor;border:medium;word-break:break-all;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;line-height:1.2;white-space:pre-wrap!important\">````</pre></span></code></pre></div><div><br></div><div>Thanks.</div><div><br></div><div>YA</div><blockquote style=\"margin-Top:0px;margin-Bottom:0px;margin-Left:0.5em;margin-Right:inherit\"><div><div>\r\n</div></div></blockquote>\r\n</div></div></blockquote>\r\n</div></blockquote></div><div><br></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
